  "text": "Kerala Tours - India | Prestige Holidays 4U Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Home Domestic International Packages Customize Trip About Contact +91 63618 77187 Domestic Kerala India Serene backwaters, lush tea gardens, and Ayurvedic wellness Why Visit Kerala? Known as &#x27;God&#x27;s Own Country,&#x27; Kerala is a tropical paradise with tranquil backwaters, pristine beaches, and misty hill stations. Experience the unique houseboat cruises through the backwaters of Alleppey, witness the tea plantations of Munnar, and rejuvenate with traditional Ayurvedic treatments. Kerala&#x27;s rich cultural heritage, delicious cuisine, and warm hospitality make it a must-visit destination. Best Time to Visit September to March Top Attractions Alleppey Backwaters Munnar Tea Gardens Previous slide Next slide Alleppey Backwaters Munnar Tea Gardens Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary Kovalam Beach Fort Kochi Athirappilly Waterfalls Activities & Experiences Houseboat Cruises Ayurvedic Spa Tea Plantation Tours Wildlife Safari Kathakali Dance Beach Relaxation Plan Your Trip Enquire Now WhatsApp Us Contact Information Phone +91 63618 77187 Email showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Your trusted partner for domestic and international travel experiences. Creating memorable journeys since years. Quick Links Home Domestic Tours International Tours Tour Packages About Us Contact Us Popular Destinations Goa Kerala Maldives Dubai Switzerland Thailand Contact Info No 638/G, HBR 1st Stage, 2nd Block, HBR Layout, Karnataka, Bengaluru – 560043 +91 63618 77187 showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com © 2026 Prestige Holidays 4U. All rights reserved. Chat with us on WhatsApp"
